        </div>
        
        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
            <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
            <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-3 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
                    <button class="accordion-button fw-semibold shadow-none" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                        How does the real-time ATS resume checker work?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body text-muted small">
                        Our ATS system scans your resume against target job descriptions using advanced NLP and keyword-matching algorithms. It evaluates formatting compatibility, structural completeness, and missing skill keywords, delivering a precise match score along with clear, actionable fix suggestions.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
            <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-3 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold shadow-none" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                        Is CareerGuide.ai free to use for students and developers?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body text-muted small">
                        Yes, absolutely! We provide a robust free tier that gives you complete access to standard career roadmaps, job board browsing, active internship listings, and basic resume analysis tools to accelerate your job search without any charges.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
            <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-3 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold shadow-none" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                        Can I get direct job and internship recommendations?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body text-muted small">
                        Yes. Once you set up your profile, input your technical skills, and specify your preferred tech stack (such as MERN, Python, Cloud, etc.), our system automatically filters and curates direct job openings and internship matches suited specifically for your level.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
            <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-3 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold shadow-none" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
                        How do the structured career roadmaps help me?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body text-muted small">
                        Our career roadmaps remove all tutorial hell and guesswork by breaking down complex engineering domains into week-by-week learning milestones, hands-on project ideas, and essential skill checkpoints tailored for modern industry standards.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
            <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-3 shadow-sm rounded-3 overflow-hidden">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold shadow-none" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">
                        How secure is my account and personal data?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body text-muted small">
                        Your data security is our top priority. We use industry-standard `bcryptjs` encryption to securely hash all passwords before saving user credentials directly into our protected MongoDB database, ensuring complete confidentiality.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
